<section class="lg3-hero"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">LOCAL GUIDE INTELLIGENCE</span><h1>Find the right place, naturally.</h1><p>Describe what you need. Search the local directory, discover places near you, compare options and get recommendations based on your saved interests.</p>
<form method="get" class="lg3-search"><input id="smartQuery" type="search" name="q" value="<?= h($q) ?>" placeholder="Try: family restaurant, dentist, quiet coffee shop…"><button class="button button-lime">Search <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button><button type="button" class="button button-light" data-voice-search="smartQuery" title="Voice search"><i class="fa-solid fa-microphone"></i> Speak</button></form>
